    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockits is a challenging 2D action platformer with crisp pixel-art visuals and tight controls. Every level is a compact trial in timing, precision, and reflexes. Each screen is carefully designed to offer a satisfying yet demanding experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Platforming challenges across dozens of precision-crafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Instant respawns keep the pace intense and engaging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Atmospheric soundtrack that enhances your focus and immersion  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840620/extras/8700ebc11faa575235b6d3ad3607b3b5.poster.avif?t=1750444498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840620/extras/8700ebc11faa575235b6d3ad3607b3b5.webm?t=1750444498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840620/extras/8700ebc11faa575235b6d3ad3607b3b5.mp4?t=1750444498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who enjoy methodical and rewarding platforming, Blockits delivers intense challenges. Always fair, never frustratingly unfair.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockits is a challenging 2D action platformer with crisp pixel-art visuals and tight controls. Every level is a compact trial in timing, precision, and reflexes. Each screen is carefully designed to offer a satisfying yet demanding experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Platforming challenges across dozens of precision-crafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Instant respawns keep the pace intense and engaging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Atmospheric soundtrack that enhances your focus and immersion  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840620/extras/8700ebc11faa575235b6d3ad3607b3b5.poster.avif?t=1750444498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840620/extras/8700ebc11faa575235b6d3ad3607b3b5.webm?t=1750444498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840620/extras/8700ebc11faa575235b6d3ad3607b3b5.mp4?t=1750444498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who enjoy methodical and rewarding platforming, Blockits delivers intense challenges. Always fair, never frustratingly unfair.</p>",
